#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0339 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "The _wildcards-absence pin, contrasted with PMDA-AD0450-skipped_index_out_of_filter. Index TEN (MCRIT10/MCRIT10ML), no single-digit pair. PMDA-AD0339 declares NO _wildcards block, so y compiles to unbounded (\d+); the capture '10' survives and ONE expansion runs and fires. The same column pair on AD0450 (which DOES declare _wildcards {y:1..9}) is filtered out entirely and SKIPPED."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID    type=Char
col USUBJID    type=Char
col PARAMCD    type=Char
col MCRIT10    type=Char
col MCRIT10ML  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT |  | PARTIAL
---
